event: thinking
data: {"id": "12e7d79e19c34615-thinking-parallel_evidence-717", "run_id": "12e7d79e19c34615", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集到关键事实：\n- 当前状态：Pod 处于 `Running` 但容器未 `Ready`，`restarts=6`，`reason=CrashLoopBackOff`，kubelet 事件显示反复 back-off。\n- 重启趋势：`kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` 从 2 持续上升至 5（60 分钟 range 区间），表明崩溃仍在发生。\n- 根因线索：`kubectl previous logs` 显示 `sh: exec: line 0: /opt/app/unavailable-command: not found`。YAML 中 `command: sh -c exec /opt/app/unavailable-command`。\n\n冲突与缺口：\n- 证据已直接指向根因：容器启动命令 `/opt/app/unavailable-command` 在镜像中不存在，导致 exitCode=127 并触发 CrashLoopBackOff。\n- 无需额外补证。", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789132153666, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

