event: node_complete
data: {"id": "12e7d79e19c34615-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "12e7d79e19c34615", "seq": 720, "ts_ms": 1789132172304, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 10.317, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1660, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v08/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod aiops-case-v08/workload 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，容器 app 无法就绪 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning BackOff 69s (x25 over 6m15s) kubelet Back-off restarting failed container app in pod workload_aiops-case-v08(00e5e755-886e-4661-9e8a-00d1e71595f6)` | 确证容器因反复失败被指数退避，触发 CrashLoopBackOff 状态 |\n| 2 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `sh: exec: line 0: /opt/app/unavailable-command: not found` (fact-1f26c7f41d44) | 直接指明启动命令中的文件缺失，是导致进程崩溃的直接原因 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `last_terminated_reason: Error`, `last_exit_code: 127` (fact-1784956446ef, fact-40286d05b529) | 终止原因非 OOMKilled 或 Liveness Probe，ExitCode 127 严格对应命令未找到 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `crash_loop_backoff` 等待消息, `restart_count: 6` (fact-6c1f68e95243, fact-20d9a3ee2a65) | 描述故障持续期间系统行为及当前观察到的重启轮次 |\n\nK8s Event 和 State 事实（#1, #3）从系统行为与退出码两个维度确认了进程启动失败的事实；Logging 事实（#2）提供了具体的错误文本，明确了失败原因是命令 `/opt/app/unavailable-command` 不存在，与 ExitCode 127 完全对应。Metrics 仅记录了重启总数（5次），未能提供趋势特征，但佐证了故障的持续性。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n容器镜像中缺失 /opt/app/unavailable-command 文件 → 容器启动执行命令 sh -c exec /opt/app/unavailable-command 失败并返回 exitCode=127 → 容器反复崩溃触发 kubelet 指数退避重启机制 (CrashLoopBackOff) → Pod 状态变为 CrashLoopBackOff 且无法就绪\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**容器启动命令指定的可执行文件 `/opt/app/unavailable-command` 在镜像中不存在**。\n- 证据 `fact-1f26c7f41d44` 明确显示执行失败并返回 `not found` 错误。\n- 证据 `fact-1784956446ef` 记录的 `exit_code: 127` 证实了该错误类型。\n- 上述直接原因导致容器崩溃，进而被 Kubernetes 标记为 `CrashLoopBackOff`（证据 `fact-e3aad077582b`, `fact-01609a468343`）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v08/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod aiops-case-v08/workload 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，容器 app 无法就绪 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning BackOff 69s (x25 over 6m15s) kubelet Back-off restarting failed container app in pod workload_aiops-case-v08(00e5e755-886e-4661-9e8a-00d1e71595f6)` | 确证容器因反复失败被指数退避，触发 CrashLoopBackOff 状态 |\n| 2 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `sh: exec: line 0: /opt/app/unavailable-command: not found` (fact-1f26c7f41d44) | 直接指明启动命令中的文件缺失，是导致进程崩溃的直接原因 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `last_terminated_reason: Error`, `last_exit_code: 127` (fact-1784956446ef, fact-40286d05b529) | 终止原因非 OOMKilled 或 Liveness Probe，ExitCode 127 严格对应命令未找到 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `crash_loop_backoff` 等待消息, `restart_count: 6` (fact-6c1f68e95243, fact-20d9a3ee2a65) | 描述故障持续期间系统行为及当前观察到的重启轮次 |\n\nK8s Event 和 State 事实（#1, #3）从系统行为与退出码两个维度确认了进程启动失败的事实；Logging 事实（#2）提供了具体的错误文本，明确了失败原因是命令 `/opt/app/unavailable-command` 不存在，与 ExitCode 127 完全对应。Metrics 仅记录了重启总数（5次），未能提供趋势特征，但佐证了故障的持续性。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n容器镜像中缺失 /opt/app/unavailable-command 文件 → 容器启动执行命令 sh -c exec /opt/app/unavailable-command 失败并返回 exitCode=127 → 容器反复崩溃触发 kubelet 指数退避重启机制 (CrashLoopBackOff) → Pod 状态变为 CrashLoopBackOff 且无法就绪\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**容器启动命令指定的可执行文件 `/opt/app/unavailable-command` 在镜像中不存在**。\n- 证据 `fact-1f26c7f41d44` 明确显示执行失败并返回 `not found` 错误。\n- 证据 `fact-1784956446ef` 记录的 `exit_code: 127` 证实了该错误类型。\n- 上述直接原因导致容器崩溃，进而被 Kubernetes 标记为 `CrashLoopBackOff`（证据 `fact-e3aad077582b`, `fact-01609a468343`）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "12e7d79e19c34615-final", "run_id": "12e7d79e19c34615", "seq": 722, "ts_ms": 1789132172329, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v08/workload` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod aiops-case-v08/workload 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，容器 app 无法就绪 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning BackOff 69s (x25 over 6m15s) kubelet Back-off restarting failed container app in pod workload_aiops-case-v08(00e5e755-886e-4661-9e8a-00d1e71595f6)` | 确证容器因反复失败被指数退避，触发 CrashLoopBackOff 状态 |\n| 2 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `sh: exec: line 0: /opt/app/unavailable-command: not found` (fact-1f26c7f41d44) | 直接指明启动命令中的文件缺失，是导致进程崩溃的直接原因 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `last_terminated_reason: Error`, `last_exit_code: 127` (fact-1784956446ef, fact-40286d05b529) | 终止原因非 OOMKilled 或 Liveness Probe，ExitCode 127 严格对应命令未找到 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `crash_loop_backoff` 等待消息, `restart_count: 6` (fact-6c1f68e95243, fact-20d9a3ee2a65) | 描述故障持续期间系统行为及当前观察到的重启轮次 |\n\nK8s Event 和 State 事实（#1, #3）从系统行为与退出码两个维度确认了进程启动失败的事实；Logging 事实（#2）提供了具体的错误文本，明确了失败原因是命令 `/opt/app/unavailable-command` 不存在，与 ExitCode 127 完全对应。Metrics 仅记录了重启总数（5次），未能提供趋势特征，但佐证了故障的持续性。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n容器镜像中缺失 /opt/app/unavailable-command 文件 → 容器启动执行命令 sh -c exec /opt/app/unavailable-command 失败并返回 exitCode=127 → 容器反复崩溃触发 kubelet 指数退避重启机制 (CrashLoopBackOff) → Pod 状态变为 CrashLoopBackOff 且无法就绪\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**容器启动命令指定的可执行文件 `/opt/app/unavailable-command` 在镜像中不存在**。\n- 证据 `fact-1f26c7f41d44` 明确显示执行失败并返回 `not found` 错误。\n- 证据 `fact-1784956446ef` 记录的 `exit_code: 127` 证实了该错误类型。\n- 上述直接原因导致容器崩溃，进而被 Kubernetes 标记为 `CrashLoopBackOff`（证据 `fact-e3aad077582b`, `fact-01609a468343`）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 35.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v08/workload: 35.3s (Evidence 27.0s, RCA 8.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v08/workload**: pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 64.169, "metrics": {"run_id": "12e7d79e19c34615", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 64.17523765563965, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "45%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 64175.23765563965, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 61208.09578895569, "tool_calls": 11, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 11, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 7568.0413246154785, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2621.2892532348633}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name